  "Comment": {
    "type": "cexostring",
    "value": "This is the default trigger for spawning Risen Undead. Risen Undead use the new \"appear\" animation to make them appear to rise from the ground when spawned.  \r\n\r\nThere are three variables attached to this trigger:\r\n\r\nQ_SPAWN_MULTIPLE - integer reference which determines how many creatures are spawned by the trigger.\r\n\r\nQ_SPAWN_RESREF0 - string reference which determines the type of undead spawned by the trigger. For triggers designed to spawn multiple creatures, multiple creature resrefs can be stored on the trigger by indexing the last digit in the variable name (e.g. Q_SPAWN_RESREF0, Q_SPAWN_RESREF1, Q_SPAWN_RESREF2, etc.). \r\n\r\nQ_SPAWN_WP - string reference for the waypoint which determines where the undead are spawned.\r\n\r\n"
  },
